{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And they did not know that Yosef understood.</b> He understood their language, and they were speaking thus in his presence." "<b>For the interpreter was between them.</b> For when they would speak with him, the interpreter was between them — one who knew the Hebrew tongue and the Egyptian tongue, and he would translate their words to Yosef and Yosef's words to them. Therefore they supposed that Yosef did not know the Hebrew tongue." "<b>The interpreter.</b> This is Menasheh."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:13.876486420Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}